''[[Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H.]]'' is an animated television series based on the superheroes [[Hulk]], [[She-Hulk]], [[Red Hulk]] ([[Thunderbolt Ross]]), [[Skaar (character)|Skaar]] and [[Rick Jones (character)|A-Bomb]]. The series premiered on [[Disney XD]] in the United States on August 11, 2013 and officially ended on June 28, 2015. ''Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H.'' aired alongside ''[[Ultimate Spider-Man (TV series)|Ultimate Spider-Man]]'', ''[[Avengers Assemble (TV series)|Avengers Assemble]]'' and ''[[Guardians of the Galaxy (TV series)|Guardians of the Galaxy]]'' during the Marvel Universe block on Disney XD.

